    "turn_text": "what they kind of led themselves to. Well, you live in a life of public service. The one thing that I know we both share, we both kind of grow up in what I call warrior class families, families I served before and kind of led that inspiration and put that seed in us. Can you talk a little bit about your upbringing? And I know from your father, your brother, your mother, everybody who seemed to be involved in the fabric of defending this country, so to speak.",
