    "turn_text": "else. It was here's an extra burden. Go get carry that torch forward because there's more responsibility that comes with that role. When you thought about when you thought about where you wanted to branch for some of our listeners who may not understand, you know, kind of the specifics and where you grew up, you know, shooting guns and sending them miles and miles and miles away. How did you decide that's what you wanted to specialize in? Oh, man.",
