    "turn_text": "your guys are looking. There's nowhere to hide. You're the first person in the stick, as you mentioned, coming out the plane. They're seeing every little piece of you're the first one to PT. all those things that happened. So it's a very different world and one that I was glad to grow up in as well. Do you find that when you were there, whether it was in Vicenza or in your career, were there any times that I know the answer is going to be yes, I'm curious where any leaders stick out to you, just moments, either your personal leadership moments or leaders that always just kind of left that mark on you and just kind of share a little bit about maybe how you even carried some of that stuff even into your career today?",
