        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Members of the Republican Party controlled the redistricting process during my time in office.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Redistricting removed me from the congressional district I represented.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "I served only one term in the United States Congress.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Being redistricted out of my district is a badge of honor to me.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "I am an elected Republican.",
        "confidence": 0.9
