    "turn_text": "you know, Greenbury officer and, you know, one of the early Greenbury 18 leaders that went into Afghanistan back in 2001. That's the type of guy that we want to be sitting on a House Armed Services Committee or Senate Armed Services Committee. You look at a lot of these Navy SEALs. People that have been on the receiving end of an AK-47, an RPG, a PKM, they kind of understand how the decisions at that strategic level affect what's going on all the way down to the tactical level. So I encourage that to happen. But again, I warn you, don't lose your soul.",
