    "turn_idx": 58,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and it's true, right? How did you, when you decided, okay, staying in, kind of continue your career, did you know that those trials of, let me ask it this way, the combat situation, how did that differ and how did you, you know, what were the big things you kind of drew from, you know, you've been in everything from Desert Shield, Desert Storm all the way into, you know, OEF and OIF kind of campaigns. How did you see that dynamically different, especially for our listeners who maybe don't have that context, you know, leading in uniform in Garrison versus leading in uniform over there, you know, in a deployed, how did that vary?",
